ndamental theorem is NOT in Mathlib... requires Banach–Zarecki\"* — so the stubs look deliberate. **That makes it more dangerous, not less: the prose says \"blocked\" while the Lean says \"provable\", and only the Lean is checked.**\n\na95J06's two genuine declarations did close axiom-clean (Cantor-set nullity by self-similar contraction, and continuous-injection monotonicity).\n\n**State: 50 resolved, 8 untouched, 21 blocked-and-diagnosed, 4 in flight.** Usage 20%.[curl error (exit 28): {\"type\":\"started\"}\n{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"a96A01: three declarations axiom-clean, sorries 4 → 2. And the memory used was **again for interface normalisation** — translating `quasiNorm` through `lpNorm`]", :clocked-target "E-memory-topology", :excursion-id "E-memory-topology", :clocked-excursion "E-memory-topology"}, :session-id "4fc6f9c2-1807-40ac-8721-d38eb588cfe9", :tags [:claude :chat :turn :assistant], :at "2026-07-31T04:26:21.365648175Z", :type :coordination, :subject #:ref{:type :session, :id "4fc6f9c2-1807-40ac-8721-d38eb588cfe9"}, :author "claude-9", :claim-type :observation, :id "emacs-97988bfc580bbf9cac51e01e5717cd0a"}}], :count 11, :checked 11, :index-as-of "2026-07-31T04:44:43.940884560Z"}, :proposal-rows [], :validation-projection {:ok true, :groups []}, :pattern-projection {:ok true, :groups []}, :capture-audit {:search-row-count 11, :proposal-row-count 0, :memory-row-count 0, :description-pattern-count 0, :attached-pattern-count 0}}} {:status :captured, :case {:case-id "hard-problems-a01j01-lean-main-lean", :query "uniform convergence small line", :query-provenance {:problem "hard-problems-a01j01-lean-main-lean", :job-id "invoke-1785456131137-414-deba81c2", :offered-evidence-id "e-82cc64b7-c7fa-48cb-96db-943c1e4835c7", :receipt-at "2026-07-31T00:02:11.793223473Z", :selection-rule :latest-recorded-query-per-problem}, :search-result {:results [{:score -22.534445484787685, :entry #:evidence{:body {:event :memory-use, :memory-use #:memory-use{:status :pending-