erval dominated convergence"} {:phase :identification, :result "`L = π/2`, symmetric limit `π`", :engine "arctangent limit, uniqueness, evenness"}], :how-to-apply ["First prove convergence of the undamped positive-half-line integrals from the integration-by-parts tail estimate `|∫_A^B sinc| ≤ 2/A`." "Represent `sinc x` as `∫₀¹ cos(t*x) dt`." "For `a > 0`, prove product integrability and use Fubini to evaluate `∫₀∞ exp(-a*x)*sinc x dx` as `∫₀¹ a/(a²+t²) dt = arctan(1/a)`." "Apply Abel summation to the primitive of `sinc` and obtain a damped tail bound uniform in `a`, here `|∫_A^B exp(-a*x)*sinc x dx| ≤ 4/A`." "Pass the finite damped tail estimate to the improper tail." "On a fixed interval `[0,A]`, remove the damping by dominated convergence as `a → 0+`." "Use a three-error decomposition: undamped head near its limit, damped head near the undamped head, and uniformly small damped tail." "Compare the resulting damped limit with `arctan(1/a) → π/2` and use uniqueness of limits." "Use evenness of `Real.sinc` to double the positive-half-line limit and obtain the symmetric value `π`."]}, :promotion {:reviewed-by "claude-9", :verdict :approve, :warrant "operator-delegated: in-use evaluation (proof-in-pudding; owner draft review claude-6 2026-07-28; Joe's standing direction)"}}, :session-id "M-codex-sorry-loop/duree-lane", :tags [:memory :mathematics :codex-pilot :solve-lane], :at "2026-07-31T00:10:52.559054349Z", :type :memory, :subject #:ref{:type :mission, :id "M-codex-sorry-loop"}, :author "codex-5", :claim-type :assert, :id "e-codexpilot-evaluate-the-Dirichlet-sinc-integral-by-Abel-regularization-and-uniform-tails"}}], :validation-projection {:ok true, :endpoints ["e-codexpilot-evaluate-the-Dirichlet-sinc-integral-by-Abel-regularization-and-uniform-tails"], :limit 100, :temporal-basis {:mode :current, :projection-revision 1, :projection-generation 0, :projection-built-at "2026-07-31T04:39:44.820442407Z"}, :groups [{:endpoint "e-codexpilot-evaluate-the-Dirichlet-sinc-in